                    <death when="1000"/>
                    <occupation/>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>The John Payne entry (1824-04-04) seems to be a reference to Lamb's cousin John Payne who married Sarah Burney, the daughter 
    of rear Admiral Burney, in April 1821. This couple probably account for the entries for  Mr and Mrs Payne and for subsequent 
    entries in the diary to Payne(s). They have been given their own code.</p>
                    </note>
                    <bibl type="printedbook">E. V. Lucas, <title>The Life of Charles Lamb</title>,   </bibl>
